      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "一、case 与多分支 if 的区别"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "一case-与多分支-if-的区别"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "case 语句和 if...elif...else 一样都是多分支条件语句。区别在于："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "case：只能判断一种条件关系（变量值等于什么），适合\"单条件多分支\""
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "if：可以判断多种条件关系（大于/小于/组合等）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、case 语法结构"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二case-语法结构"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "case $变量名 in\n\"值 1\")\n    如果变量的值等于值1，则执行程序1\n    ;;\n\"值 2\")\n    如果变量的值等于值2，则执行程序2\n    ;;\n…省略其他分支…\n*)\n    如果变量的值都不是以上的值，则执行此程序\n    ;;\nesac"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "语法要点："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "以 case 开头，以 esac 结尾（case 倒写）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "每个分支以 ;;（双分号）结尾，代表该程序段结束——千万不要忘记"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "*) 为兜底分支，匹配所有其他值"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "case 会取出变量值逐一与各分支比较，符合则执行对应程序"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "三、完整示例：选择 yes/no"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "三完整示例选择-yesno"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "#!/bin/bash\n# 判断用户输入\nread -p \"Please choose yes/no: \" -t 30 cho\n# 在屏幕上输出\"请选择yes/no\"，然后把用户选择赋予变量cho\ncase $cho in\n# 判断变量cho的值\n    \"yes\")\n    # 如果是yes\n        echo \"Your choose is yes!\"\n        # 则执行程序1\n        ;;\n    \"no\")\n    # 如果是no\n        echo \"Your choose is no!\"\n        # 则执行程序2\n        ;;\n    *)\n    # 如果既不是yes,也不是no\n    echo \"Your choose is error!\"\n    # 则执行此程序\n    ;;\nesac"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "四、经典用法：uname 分支判断"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "四经典用法uname-分支判断"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "os400=false\ncase \"`uname`\" in\nOS400*) os400=true;;\nesac"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "该写法常见于跨平台脚本：通过 uname 输出判断当前系统类型（如 AIX 的 OS400），进而选择不同的命令分支。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
